{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","title":"G10 optimization proposal","description":"What RunSummary.propose persists and asks G10 to approve. This schema described an invented flat document until 2026-09-07 -- top-level root_cause/target_files/verification_commands/status/g10_approval_id/g10_input_hash, with target_files as bare relative path strings -- and nothing ever loaded it, so the divergence was free. It is loaded now, before the proposal is saved. target_files carry resolved absolute paths and their before/after hashes; confinement to the approved roots is enforced in _normalize_candidate, which can compare real paths, and is not something a schema can check.","type":"object","required":["schema_version","proposal_id","run_id","summary_hash","summary_artifact_id","candidate_hash","candidate","candidate_diff","allowed_roots","approval_gate","expected_benefit","risk","rollback","evidence","envelope_hash"],"properties":{"schema_version":{"const":"1"},"proposal_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/sha256"},"run_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"summary_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/sha256"},"summary_artifact_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/sha256"},"candidate_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/sha256"},"candidate":{"type":"object","required":["root_cause","expected_benefit","risk","rollback","target_files","verification_commands"],"properties":{"root_cause":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"expected_benefit":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"risk":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"rollback":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"target_files":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"object","required":["path","before_sha256","content","content_sha256"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"before_sha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/sha256"},"content":{"type":"string"},"content_sha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/sha256"}},"additionalProperties":false}},"verification_commands":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}}},"additionalProperties":false},"candidate_diff":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"allowed_roots":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1}},"approval_gate":{"const":"G10"},"expected_benefit":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"risk":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"rollback":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"evidence":{"type":"object","required":["failure_groups","summary_artifact_id"],"properties":{"failure_groups":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"summary_artifact_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/sha256"}},"additionalProperties":false},"envelope_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/sha256"}},"$defs":{"sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}},"additionalProperties":false}
